      "en": "The streets of the city will be full of boys and girls playing in its streets.”",
      "ko": "그 성읍 거리에 동남과 동녀가 가득하여 거기서 장난하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "ca9c8c27bf15c0d8abdaee9371af9dab86dea5efae9cf04694aba71c9ae7b8f1",
