      ],
      "en": "The LORD of Armies says: “Let your hands be strong, you who hear in these days these words from the mouth of the prophets who were in the day that the foundation of the house of the LORD of Armies was laid, even the temple, that it might be built.",
      "ko": "만군의 여호와가 말하노라 만군의 여호와의 집 곧 전을 건축하려고 그 지대를 쌓던 날에 일어난 선지자들의 입의 말을 이 때에 듣는 너희는 손을 견고히 할지어다",
      "source_text_hash": "bf84c32f44bf066ef1a1729077b263799d8033860dc1a479b505bcf27b7bcee6",
      "translation_text_hash": "1638da865c4b8bf0614d559d4da7664b60380f376364de5a627b8c742f8e719a",
